:Torino obiettivo finale. Un'indagine di Crema e Bernardini"[
YAndy Cox, Jon Ingold, Melissa Yuan-Innes, Jason Sanford, David D. Levine, Mario Milosevic"š
—'Is Paris Burning?' reconstructs, in meticulous detail, the network of fateful events...day by day...moment by moment... that saved Paris, the City of Light, from the Nazis.
